# WO-1348 - the GENERATED VFX pick option pool ships as TWO byte-identical copies (the
# Command Center reads one, the build reads the other) and test/vfx-pick-options.test.js
# pins them LF-only. core.autocrlf is true on this machine and .gitattributes carries no
# *.json rule, so without these two lines a FRESH CLONE would check both files out as CRLF
# and that oracle would go red on a defect that is git configuration, not content.
api/_lib/vfx-pick-options.generated.json text eol=lf
